WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.075
Watch where the score is kept.

2
00:00:03.719 --> 00:00:07.144
The score is kept in memory while the console is on.

3
00:00:09.048 --> 00:00:11.423
Saving copies it into storage.

4
00:00:14.437 --> 00:00:18.637
Turn it off and on. Memory is empty. Storage kept the save.
